<problem><title>Video review question</title>

<exercise includeAutoNumber="true"><title />
<p>Consider line <m>AB</m> in the graph of the function <m>f</m> below. This line is called a <textInput name="vid1Review1_secant" isResponse="true" /> line  and its slope tells us the <em>average</em> rate of change of the function <m>f</m> between points <m>A</m> and <m>B</m>.</p>
<p>Line <m>AC</m>, by contrast, is known as a <textInput name="vid1Review1_tangent" isResponse="true" /> line, and its slope tells us the <em>instantaneous</em> rate of change of the function <m>f</m> at point <m>A</m>.</p>

<answer matchPartial="true" name="ans1" type="text">
  <award>
    <when>$vid1Review1_secant = secant and $vid1Review1_tangent = tangent</when>
  </award>
</answer>

<graph xmin="-2" ymin="-1" xmax="5" ymax="6">
    <function name="f" applyStyleToLabel="true">-(x+0.5)(x-3.5)
      <label><m>f(x)</m></label>
    </function>
    <point name="A" styleNumber="5" labelPosition="left" fixed="true">(0,$$f(0))
      <label><m>A</m></label>
    </point>
    <point name="B" styleNumber="5" fixed="true">(1.5,$$f(1.5))
      <label><m>B</m></label>
    </point>
    <line name="AB" styleNumber="2" through="$A $B" applyStyleToLabel="true">
    </line>
    <function name="f_prime" hide="true"><derivative>$f</derivative></function>
    <function name="AC" styleNumber="3" applyStyleToLabel="true">$$f_prime($A.x) x + $A.y
    </function>
    <point name="C" styleNumber="5" fixed="true">(1,$$AC(1))
      <label><m>C</m></label>
    </point>
  </graph>


<hint hide="$ans1.numSubmissions &lt; 2 or $ans1.creditAchieved = 1 or $ans1.numSubmissions >= 5">
  <p>To answer the first part of this question, see <ref to="$vid_section">Key moment 1</ref> and observe the graph. What is the name for a line that intersects a curve at two points?</p>
  <p>To answer the second part of this question, see <ref to="$vid_section">Key moment 3</ref> and observe the graph. What is the name for a line that touches a curve at only a single point?</p>
  </hint>

  <hint hide="$ans1.numSubmissions &lt; 5 or $ans1.creditAchieved = 1">
    <p>The name for a line that intersects a curve at two points is a <alert>secant</alert> line</p>
    <p>The name for a line that touches a curve at only a single point is a <alert>tangent</alert> line</p>
  </hint>
<solution>
  <ol>
    <li>secant</li>
    <li>tangent</li>
  </ol>
</solution>
</exercise>
